<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Wording that exists only on the phone.

  Everything in strings_feelm.xml comes from feelm-sk's dictionaries. These are
  strings the web app has no equivalent for — a cropper hint, a bottom-bar
  label — so they are written here and translated alongside in values-az,
  values-tr and values-ru.

  If any of these later earn a place on the web too, add the key to
  lib/i18n/messages/en.js instead and delete it from here, so the two clients
  keep saying the same thing in the same words.
-->
